agent-ops task task-611352c5-e046-4979-b8f8-77e3951d649f: Review finding origin (pre-existing non-blocking) and review round cap
intent: Add optional finding origin introduced|pre-existing (pre-existing => blocking false at any severity; absent => introduced). Prompt both rounds with the definition; report only pre-existing defects met on the normal read path. In runReviewCommand, count FAIL artifacts for the task under the current taskContractHash newer than its latest PASS; at 3 return NOT_RUN round-cap before launching any target. Constant 3, no config. Run needs no change: repeated identical failures already stop via noProgressForTwoRounds.
criteria:
- report-origin: validateReviewReport accepts optional finding origin restricted to introduced|pre-existing, rejects other values with INVALID_FINDING, rejects pre-existing with blocking true (INVALID_FINDING) while allowing pre-existing blocking false at any severity including critical, keeps the old severity rules for explicit introduced and for absent origin, preserves origin as given (absent stays absent), and validateFollowupFinding accepts a pre-existing non-blocking finding; unit tests in tests/review/report.test.ts cover each.
- prompt-schema-origin: Primary and adversarial review prompts define pre-existing (present at base; change did not introduce, expose, worsen or depend on it), instruct blocking false for every pre-existing finding, limit reporting to defects met on the normal read path, and include origin?:'introduced'|'pre-existing' in the required shape; schemas/review-report.schema.json declares finding origin as an optional enum of exactly introduced and pre-existing; tests/review/runner.test.ts asserts both.
- review-round-cap: runReviewCommand returns the ordinary NOT_RUN envelope with reason round-cap, executing no reviewer and writing no review artifact, when the task has 3 or more FAIL artifacts under its current taskContractHash newer than its latest PASS (all such FAILs count when no PASS exists); with fewer than 3 the reviewer runs; NOT_RUN and unreadable artifacts are not counted; a newer PASS resets the count, and after task revise changes the contract hash the reviewer runs again; the returned text names task revise with a reason or asking the user; tests in tests/review/prior-findings.test.ts and tests/review/command.test.ts cover each case.
- docs-origin-roundcap: docs/en/spec/review.md and docs/zh-TW/spec/review.md describe finding origin and the round cap, and CHANGELOG.md has an Unreleased entry for both.
